  "openQuestions": [
    "Two different windows coexist: manual send (MessageView / patient side panel) blocks ad at >= 20:50, while scheduled contacts/contact rules block ad after 20:30. Redesign proposes a single server policy.",
    "All checks use the browser's local time (getHours/getMinutes); fixtures assume Asia/Seoul. Server must evaluate in KST explicitly.",
    "Manual-send night check covers both SMS and Kakao brand messages (Da is keyed on messageType '광고' only, not channel).",
    "Contact rules with 기준 '잔여 횟수' skip the window check entirely; unclear whether the send-time is then decided by the server.",
    "Night check is only a UI block (banner + disabled test send + error); whether the server also rejects is unknown."
  ]
}
